MUST MAKE FOR PROJECT
=====================
IsPageTracked() Determine whether a page belongs to one of your monitored regions

GetTrackedPage() Return your project's metadata for a page.

IsFirstWriteOfCycle() Return whether the page has already faulted this synchronization cycle.  bitmap

GetRegionForAddress() Determine which tracked region contains an address.
